Maintainer: HiFiBerry <support@hifiberry.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.0
Homepage: https://hifiberry.com/os

Package: hifiberry-pipewire-configs
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, pipewire
Recommends: pipewire-pulse, wireplumber
Description: HiFiBerry PipeWire configuration files
 This package provides PipeWire configuration files optimized for HiFiBerry
 audio systems and headless environments.
 .
 Included configurations:
  - 90-hifiberry-effects.conf: Advanced audio processing with parametric EQ,
    balance control, and mono/stereo conversion
  - 99-hifiberry-headless.conf: Optimized configuration for headless systems
    without D-Bus session or X11 dependencies
 .
 These configurations enhance audio quality and provide advanced DSP features
 while maintaining compatibility with headless and embedded audio systems.